 "remarks": "Sun-Filled Corner End-Unit in Premier Kingswood Community, Darien/Stamford Line   Discover effortless living in this spacious, sun-drenched corner end-unit on the third floor of the sought-after Kingswood at Stamford. Perfectly positioned on the Darien-Stamford border, this residence offers the ideal blend of tranquility and convenience, with immediate access to I-95, Chelsea Piers, and downtown Stamford.   Residence Highlights: Open & Airy Layout: Features a generous open-concept living and dining area, ideal for entertaining.  Modern Kitchen: Updated kitchen with a casual breakfast bar. Primary Suite: The expansive master bedroom includes an en-suite bathroom and two floor-to-ceiling closets for ample storage. Flexible Second Bedroom: Accommodates guests or a home office, served by a conveniently located second full bathroom. End-Unit Privacy: Enjoy extra light and reduced neighbor noise as a corner unit.  Parking & Storage: Includes one assigned off-street parking space and basement storage.   Community Amenities:  Social Hub: A vibrant clubhouse with a wet bar, lounge, fireplace, and pool table.  Outdoor Living: Sunny courtyard patio with BBQ grilling area.   Investment Opportunity: Currently tenant-occupied with a lease in place until March 2027, offering immediate income stability for investors. Whether you are looking to downsize, invest, or enjoy a lock-and-leave lifestyle, this unit presents a rare opportunity in a well-maintained, active community.",
